# Form hooks

Do **not** import `useField`, `useFormContext`, `useFormErrors`, or `useFieldError` from `vee-validate`.

Always import them from `@/hooks/form`.

The only exception is `src/hooks/form/index.js`, which wraps vee-validate.

```js
// ❌ BAD
import { useField, useFormContext, useFormErrors, useFieldError } from 'vee-validate';

// ✅ GOOD
import { useField, useFormContext, useFormErrors, useFieldError } from '@/hooks/form';
```
